  isAutomatic: 0
  ChangeTimeOfAction: 1
  Text: "It's a service station lazily named \"Petro Station\". \n  \nNot much to
    look around. \n  \nThere are quite a lot of <link>security cameras</link>, some
    even pointing at the crash site, it also has a public <link>bathroom</link> at
    the side. That's fortunate in case we have to stay here for too long. \n \nThe
    only person around is a counter boy that calls himself <link>Petro Boy</link>. "
  TextForRepetition: 'We already did that, remember?

    The report is probably
    on your desk, or in the DB if you uploaded it.'
